 { White has more space in the centre, and can grab further space by advancing any of the pawns from the c- to the e-file. Which of these three moves do you think is best? } 12. { -KEY- } e5 $1 Ng8 ( 12... Nh7 $6 13. Bxh6 $18 ) 
